5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what it's actually like for people! I'll look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and the visit to the station block's bin house.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to make sure we're being fair with the costs. I'll look into the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll handle the bureaucracy. I'll look into the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk and the ward complaint log for this point. Let's see exactly how much the ward office is annoyed with us.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'll take a look at the station block's meeting minutes and the statements at the residents' meeting. I want to see what people are actually complaining about behind the scenes!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the measurements of the five frontages and the truck arrival time from the crew leader. I want to understand the physical constraints and the actual timing of the collection.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Rin,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,pass,Midori,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I think we've covered all the bases for now. No need to overcomplicate the research phase. I'm curious to see if the complaint log is as dramatic as I expect.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I'm with you, Shunichi! I have a feeling those meeting minutes are going to be a goldmine of neighborhood drama. This should be interesting!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree. We have a comprehensive list of data points. I will focus on the objective measurements and timing to ensure any proposed solution is grounded in physical reality.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm just so excited to see how the other neighborhoods do it! Maybe they have some super cool ideas we haven't thought of yet. I hope the bin house is like a little fort!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I hope so too, Rin! It would be lovely if we could find a solution that makes everyone happy. I'm just a bit worried about how the costs will be split among us.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, costs are just numbers. What really matters is whether we can agree on them without starting another neighborhood war. Let's hope the data keeps us civil.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, a little drama keeps things lively, doesn't it? But you're right, let's just hope we don't end up as the main topic of the next residents' meeting!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"While drama may be entertaining for some, it is a distraction. We should prioritize a sustainable and equitable arrangement over neighborhood gossip. I will wait for the results of our research.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready! I can't wait to find out if the other lane's mornings are fun or just boring. Let's see what we find!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'm ready too. I'll do my best to find the financial details so we can all feel comfortable with the plan.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'm ready. Let's see if the ward office's records are as tedious as the actual process of talking to each other.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,May,,I'm all set! I'll be waiting to see if the gossip matches the reality. Let's get to it!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
