28,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I am ready. I will analyze the data objectively to ensure the final arrangement is fair and practical for everyone involved.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
